{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "34facfb5-f24f-836b-8360-1f3d90e535ac",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T10:47:19-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:44:57-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:00-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Lombardi. My name is Hector Valdez. I would like to inquire about fence requirements, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:07-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What are you looking to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:11-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have an old wooden fence at my home that has rotted through in several places. I intend to remove it and install a new one in exactly the same location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:21-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:24-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fourteen Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:26-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What kind of fence are you putting in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:30-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am planning on vinyl. I would like it to be as tall as the city allows, whatever that happens to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:38-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So the main thing is, yes, a fence generally does need a permit here, even when you're replacing one in the same spot. Height limits depend on where it sits on the lot, front yard versus back, so that'll get looked at when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:45:53-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Then may I ask whether the contractor handles the permit, or is that the responsibility of the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:00-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to be certain I do it properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:04-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one can do it. A lot of contractors will pull it for you, but you want to confirm that with whoever you hire before they start. If they say it's on you, you can apply yourself. The owner's name is still on the property either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:19-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is very helpful. And how long does approval usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:23-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends how busy we are and whether the application is complete. Figure a matter of days to a couple of weeks. If you've got a survey or a sketch showing where the fence goes, include that, it moves faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:36-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do have a plot plan from when I purchased the house. I will locate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:42-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Bring it in or send it with the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:46-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I must confess, I was rather nervous about making this call. I did not know whether I was doing something wrong by replacing it without asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:46:56-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're doing it the right way by asking first. Just don't start tearing anything out until the permit's issued."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:47:03-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I will wait for the permit before any work begins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:47:07-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You can stop by the office or call back if you have questions about the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:47:13-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate your time, Mr. Lombardi. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T10:47:16-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Valdez. Take care."
    }
  ],
